{"title":"Minggu 14 — AI-Mediated Communication","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Minggu 14 — AI-Mediated Communication","description":"AI sebagai Mirror, Coach, Translator, Copilot, Mediator, dan Delegate."},"headingText":"Hasil belajar","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.week-path}\n::: {}\nAI dapat memperbesar kualitas maupun kesalahan komunikasi. Minggu ini melatih pemilihan peran AI, person-centered prompting, human review, dan authority boundary.\n:::\n::: {tag=\"aside\"}\n**Capaian utama**\n\nMampu menggunakan AI secara proporsional sambil mempertahankan human responsibility dan relationship ownership.\n:::\n:::\n\n\n- Membedakan enam peran AI dalam komunikasi.\n- Menetapkan data, values, constraints, authority, dan review.\n- Menilai privacy, profiling, manipulation, dependency, dan authority error.\n\n## Materi slide\n\n[Buka slide Minggu 14](../slides/minggu-14.html){.slide-link target=\"_blank\"}\n\n## Konsep kunci\n\n`AI supports intelligence; persons retain relationship, authority, and responsibility.`\n\n## Quiz formatif\n\n<div class=\"quiz\" data-quiz-id=\"week-14\">\n<fieldset data-answer=\"c\"><legend>1. Perbedaan Copilot dan Delegate adalah …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q1\" value=\"a\"> Delegate selalu lebih akurat.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q1\" value=\"b\"> Copilot tidak menggunakan AI.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q1\" value=\"c\"> Delegate bertindak dalam authority boundary; Copilot membantu human yang bertindak.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"a\"><legend>2. Communication dengan relationship risk tinggi sebaiknya …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q2\" value=\"a\"> Tetap human-owned meskipun AI membantu persiapan.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q2\" value=\"b\"> Didelegasikan agar lebih efisien.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q2\" value=\"c\"> Dikirim tanpa review untuk menjaga spontanitas.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"b\"><legend>3. Human-in-the-loop yang nyata memerlukan …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q3\" value=\"a\"> Tombol approve saja.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q3\" value=\"b\"> Pemahaman, waktu menolak, visibility uncertainty, dan accountability.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q3\" value=\"c\"> Penggunaan model terbesar.</label></fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"quiz-submit\">Periksa jawaban</button><p class=\"quiz-result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n</div>\n\n## Evidence pencapaian\n\nDokumentasikan case, AI role, prompt, output, human revision, authority boundary, risk, dan relationship review.\n\n[Isi evidence Minggu 14](../portfolio/week-14.qmd){.slide-link}\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.week-path}\n::: {}\nAI dapat memperbesar kualitas maupun kesalahan komunikasi. Minggu ini melatih pemilihan peran AI, person-centered prompting, human review, dan authority boundary.\n:::\n::: {tag=\"aside\"}\n**Capaian utama**\n\nMampu menggunakan AI secara proporsional sambil mempertahankan human responsibility dan relationship ownership.\n:::\n:::\n\n## Hasil belajar\n\n- Membedakan enam peran AI dalam komunikasi.\n- Menetapkan data, values, constraints, authority, dan review.\n- Menilai privacy, profiling, manipulation, dependency, dan authority error.\n\n## Materi slide\n\n[Buka slide Minggu 14](../slides/minggu-14.html){.slide-link target=\"_blank\"}\n\n## Konsep kunci\n\n`AI supports intelligence; persons retain relationship, authority, and responsibility.`\n\n## Quiz formatif\n\n<div class=\"quiz\" data-quiz-id=\"week-14\">\n<fieldset data-answer=\"c\"><legend>1. Perbedaan Copilot dan Delegate adalah …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q1\" value=\"a\"> Delegate selalu lebih akurat.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q1\" value=\"b\"> Copilot tidak menggunakan AI.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q1\" value=\"c\"> Delegate bertindak dalam authority boundary; Copilot membantu human yang bertindak.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"a\"><legend>2. Communication dengan relationship risk tinggi sebaiknya …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q2\" value=\"a\"> Tetap human-owned meskipun AI membantu persiapan.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q2\" value=\"b\"> Didelegasikan agar lebih efisien.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q2\" value=\"c\"> Dikirim tanpa review untuk menjaga spontanitas.</label></fieldset>\n<fieldset data-answer=\"b\"><legend>3. Human-in-the-loop yang nyata memerlukan …</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q3\" value=\"a\"> Tombol approve saja.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q3\" value=\"b\"> Pemahaman, waktu menolak, visibility uncertainty, dan accountability.</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"w14q3\" value=\"c\"> Penggunaan model terbesar.</label></fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"quiz-submit\">Periksa jawaban</button><p class=\"quiz-result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n</div>\n\n## Evidence pencapaian\n\nDokumentasikan case, AI role, prompt, output, human revision, authority boundary, risk, dan relationship review.\n\n[Isi evidence Minggu 14](../portfolio/week-14.qmd){.slide-link}\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-f